 cafés e conveniências do Batel;\nEstrutura de lazer com salão de festas, salão de jogos e área externa;\nPortaria em horário comercial, depósito privativo e 4 vagas de garagem demarcadas.\n\nPor que escolher esta cobertura no Batel?\nLocalização premium com total privacidade e exclusividade;\nIdeal para famílias que valorizam conforto, espaço e lazer em casa;\nAmbientes versáteis para personalização conforme seu estilo de vida.\n\nAgende sua visita e viva o alto padrão no Batel com elegância, espaço e sofisticação.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/787a6316-274c-4484-8bff-ae5708ad162e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/212f363a-3d9c-4f6e-aba9-88eafb79c71c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/dda4c762-49b4-4915-8646-1cc73598499f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e383d097-37c9-40b5-b769-e5137525fd12.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3400d855-fc59-45d7-9cd8-113fda54da4b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8519ffea-e8b8-4c4a-a5ab-7a24d3b745de.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4080da09-e048-4d67-846d-5dbe9d3be410.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8e4e3c4b-3ba1-405d-9613-7564e67e8985.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3f39a452-e80d-40d2-a952-cecbb84e2592.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6866df4b8036adf64dc5dcfc/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1d911ab4-ba44-464d-9d